<h2>General information only</h2><p>This website is educational and general. It describes how insurance appraisal commonly works, but your policy’s wording controls. Read your own policy and its endorsements.</p>
<h2>Not legal advice, not public adjusting</h2><p>Kentucky Insurance Appraiser provides appraisal, estimating and umpire services. We are not attorneys, we don’t give legal advice, and we don’t act as public adjusters or negotiate claims outside the appraisal process.</p>
<h2>No guaranteed results</h2><p>Every claim is different. Example figures on this site are illustrative and are not results for any client. No appraiser can guarantee an award.</p>
<h2>Deadlines</h2><p>Policies contain deadlines for notice, proof of loss, replacement-cost recovery and lawsuits. Nothing on this site extends or changes a deadline. If one is close, talk to a Kentucky attorney promptly.</p>
<h2>Statutes and agencies</h2><p>References to Kentucky law, the Kentucky Department of Insurance, the Kentucky FAIR Plan or past storms are for context only. Check current law and facts with official sources.</p>
<h2>Photographs</h2><p>Photos are royalty-free stock and public-domain images used for illustration. They don’t show our clients’ properties.</p></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Free claim conversation</h2><p>Tell us what the carrier offered. We’ll say plainly whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>(844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn coral full" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a><small><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg> Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></aside></div>
